{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e14-scene-20",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "出发欧洲前的代购清单  (Shopping Lists Before Flying Overseas)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in the office, Xingzi hands excited Bu Xiaogu a duty-free shopping list before Xiaogu and Kaiwen fly abroad as the advance reality-show crew, and Chun Yuqiao checks on her thesis draft. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我的代购清单，谢谢了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你不去欧洲吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "跟老大确认过了，这次录制你跟凯文去打前站，我在家留守。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这个包法国专卖店的比较便宜，钱我一会儿转给你啊，拜托了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我从来没去过欧洲，我之前都让别人帮我代购。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "期待吧？兴奋吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是我第一次做真人秀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "从我考进传媒学院那天，我就盼着有这一天了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那你就好好享受二十四小时超工作负荷的豪华旅行吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你论文写完了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "快了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "出发之前写完一稿，到了欧洲你就没时间写了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我的代购清单，谢谢了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here is my overseas shopping list—thank you in advance.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你不去欧洲吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you not flying to Europe with us?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "跟老大确认过了，这次录制你跟凯文去打前站，我在家留守。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I confirmed with the boss: you and Kaiwen go ahead as the advance team while I hold down the fort here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "这个包法国专卖店的比较便宜，钱我一会儿转给你啊，拜托了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This bag is cheaper at boutiques in France; I will transfer you the money shortly—counting on you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我从来没去过欧洲，我之前都让别人帮我代购。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have never been to Europe before; I always asked others to shop abroad for me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "期待吧？兴奋吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Looking forward to it? Excited?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这是我第一次做真人秀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is my very first time producing a reality show!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "从我考进传媒学院那天，我就盼着有这一天了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ever since the day I got into Media College, I have dreamed of this day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那你就好好享受二十四小时超工作负荷的豪华旅行吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then enjoy your twenty-four-hour, overloaded luxury working trip!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你论文写完了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you finished writing your thesis yet?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "快了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Almost!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "出发之前写完一稿，到了欧洲你就没时间写了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Finish a full first draft before departure; once you land in Europe you will have zero time to write.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我的代购清单，谢谢了。",
      "gap": 0.5
